    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban the use of bottom net trawlers in UK waters",
        "additional_details": "This would help prevent and repair the sea bed and give nature a time to heal and help us protect the planet for future generations.",
        "background": "I want the Government to ban bottom trawlers in UK waters and enforce a no-trawling policy with them as, seeing the damage after swimming and watching documentaries, this needs to change and be stopped.",
